### Rotating Card (Hover Effect)

Below is a minimal, self‑contained example that shows how to create a “card” element that flips (rotates) when you hover over it.  
Feel free to copy the code into an `.html` file and open it in a browser to see the effect.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Rotating Card Demo</title>
<style>
/* ---------- 1️⃣ Basic reset & layout ---------- */
body {
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    min-height:100vh;
    margin:0;
    background:#f0f0f0;
    font-family:sans-serif;
}

/* ---------- 2️⃣ Card container ---------- */
.card {
    width:260px;
    height:160px;
    perspective:800px;          /* Needed for 3D effect */
    cursor:pointer;
}

/* ---------- 3️⃣ Card inner wrapper (holds front & back) ---------- */
.card-inner {
    position:relative;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    transition:transform 0.6s;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;   /* Keep children in 3D space */
}

/* ---------- 4️⃣ Front & Back faces ---------- */
.card-front,
.card-back {
    position:absolute;
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    backface-visibility:hidden;   /* Hide the back face when turned */
    border-radius:12px;
    box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    align-items:center;
    font-size:1.4rem;
    color:white;
}

.card-front { background:#3498db; }
.card-back  { background:#e74c3c; transform:rotateY(180deg); }

/* ---------- 5️⃣ Hover effect ---------- */
.card:hover .card-inner {
    transform:rotateY(180deg);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
    <div class="card-inner">
        <div class="card-front">Front Side</div>
        <div class="card-back">Back Side</div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
```

#### How it works

| Step | What happens | Why |
|------|--------------|-----|
| **1** | `perspective` on `.card` | Gives depth to the 3D rotation. |
| **2** | `.card-inner` has `transform-style: preserve-3d` | Keeps child elements (`.card-front`, `.card-back`) in 3D space. |
| **3** | `backface-visibility:hidden` | Hides the backside of each face when it’s turned away from the viewer. |
| **4** | `.card-back` is pre‑rotated 180° | Places it behind the front face initially. |
| **5** | On hover, `.card-inner` rotates 180° | Flips the whole card, revealing the back side. |

#### Customization tips

- **Rotation axis** – change `rotateY` to `rotateX` for a vertical flip, or combine both for a more complex effect.
- **Speed** – adjust `transition: transform 0.6s` to make it faster/slower.
- **Perspective** – tweak `perspective:800px` for a stronger or weaker 3D feel.
- **Content** – replace the text with images, icons, or any HTML you like.

Enjoy experimenting!
